<p>loading, discharging in the Black Sea port of Constanta on</p>
<p>Friday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>   SHIP		     COMMODITY    OPERATION   TONNES</p>
<p> - Agnita		    phosphate     dsg	 11,565</p>
<p> - Sammarina		 nitrate	 ldg	  8,535</p>
<p> - Halima K		  phosphate     dsg	  4,311</p>
<p> - Khaldoun		  amonium nit.  ldg *	6,800</p>
<p> - Sambra		    nitrate	 ldg	  5,030</p>
<p> - Bumbesti		  phospate	dsg	 23,100</p>
<p> - Karema		    urea	    ldg	  9,000</p>
<p> - Fortune Beta	    iron sheet    ldg	 13,800</p>
<p> - Hokaido Star	    ore	     dsg	157,817</p>
<p> - Lowlands Jade	   ore	     dsg	145,000</p>
<p> - Trinity Sierra	  cement	  ldg	 14,000</p>
<p> - Summit		    cement	  ldg	  9,500</p>
<p> - Super Spirit	    raw sugar     dsg	 16,500</p>
